I am strongly in favor of the nomenclature of the Electronic Manuscript
Standard (ANSI Z39.59-1988), otherwise known as the AAP dtd.

book|article|journal =3D=3D (fm, bdy, bm)

fm: front matter
bdy: body, which in turn is defined as 1 or more =
chapters|sections|articles
bm: back matter

Nico


